{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st05","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_04","title":"登陆点","storyCode":"SN-ST-5","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st05.txt","sourceHash":"b922361f2eabf19eb74b44a19181a7522efc699d7ff5a065c02f0e2b1eb4665a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......这些，恶心的地面，是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这些恐鱼吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿玛雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？这些深海教徒，你不是说他们不会出现吗？他们把这里弄得一团糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈，我是来道别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时候差不多了，而现在机会难得，我只是这么觉得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官已经到了。足足三位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪在他们手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，蒂亚戈。乔迪是以自己的意志回到的这里。三名审判官，你能做些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知不知道被审判庭发现意味着什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过很多次，我想他应该知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但人就是这样。趋利避害只是逻辑推论得出的结果，人复杂得多，而这种复杂不能被轻易评判......我不会说乔迪愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可不是当道德家的时候——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们谈论的是性质，而非道德，蒂亚戈镇长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人之性具有美感。连时间都否定不了这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底要说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憎恨审判庭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐鱼确实遍布小镇，但是，蒂亚戈，回忆一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个雨夜，那些惩戒军，他们闯入镇上，撕碎房门。惨叫不绝于耳，盖过淅沥沥的雨点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，别说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——现在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海的痕迹蔓延在这座小镇上——你听见惨叫了吗？你看到无理由的杀戮或狩猎了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的格兰法洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——徒留静谧而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋原来，这么广阔......"},{"type":"narration","text":"海风吹过。\n乔迪不可置信地看着眼前的一切。他本以为海平线就是天空的终点。\n直到亲眼确认这无限延伸的浪潮时——乔迪——这个阿戈尔人突然产生了一个疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么人类从来没有过探索它的欲望呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......除非星星是有规律的地图，或者双月能变成信号塔，否则我们怎么才能在这一片汪洋上确认方位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，星星是没有规律的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去问专业的天文学家好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果......阿戈尔真的在海面以下，那阿戈尔究竟有多大......比伊比利亚还要大吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边有几个真正的阿戈尔人，你要不要去问问看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们好像都有心事的样子，一脸严肃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，你在听什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海风中夹杂着亲缘的馈赠，让我......很安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"越接近海洋，她越是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"在盐风城的时候她明明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道原因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的猜测只会干扰你的判断，我们的眼前是战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侥幸上岸之后，你有试过回到海洋吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，然后失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它们无穷无尽，包围着我，我只是游出去没多远就失去了力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我试了很多很多次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都清楚我们自己身上发生的变化，斯卡蒂。你也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼虽然遭受了一些伤害，但她是我的猎人，她才不会那么脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她与我们是一样的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"“幽灵鲨”，曾是深海教会的受害者。源石，这种东西不存在于海洋，对她产生了各种影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"为何要带着这样的不确定因素？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回家，与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"家？但是阿戈尔的情况不会比伊比利亚好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提起你的灯，审判官。先准备迎接敌人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，它们来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"深海猎人真只有三人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果还有别人，我早该找到他们才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么这么问？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"突然出现的恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诡异的窸窣声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"航向准确吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"无误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......靠近伊比利亚之眼后，恐鱼展现出了更明确的敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里兴许已是它们的巢穴，在船上缠斗实在浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，鲨鱼，你们保护这艘船，也顺便看着点那些原始的信号导航设备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去海里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在海里更强，但它们也是。而且我们不能在海里流血，那太危险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？！又有怪物袭击了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，看不见！我们不知道水下发生了什么，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉闷的轰鸣......！下面发生了什么？她在下面战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是在......移动。毕竟在水里，她更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在水里怎么可能比在空气中速度还快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"习惯吧，或者是技巧一类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"恐鱼随她去了。她开辟了一条道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，你带着布雷奥甘的后裔继续掌舵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"速度快，在敌人包围我们之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经出发了，海上不会平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果担心他们，我们就赶紧完成我们的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛本就是收复灯塔的前哨，我们要做的只是重拾这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚竟然已经能够利用阿戈尔的技术抵御溟痕的入侵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们进化的速度快过任何一位科学家的大脑，要赢，就要不择手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕动用了一支军队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是座不起眼的小镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许有更多的战略重地等着审判庭一一收复。更好的作战地点，更宏伟的高墙与碉堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，有时候，从手边事做起，也不是什么坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少伊比利亚人愿意与浪潮厮杀至死，我们就有多少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，开始扫除吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（持续的窸窣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......我们还没到吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按、按照海图，我们至少已经能看见它了才对啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！再深入下去，恐怕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"抬头看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i27"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？明明黑漆漆一片，我什么都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......那不是......那不是天空，那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里已是它们的巢穴。离海岸很近，难怪那些恐鱼数量如此之多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"砍完就可以了吧。像以前那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对，像以前那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是......他们的眼睛？为什么我能感觉到如此熟悉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它蒙于污秽许久，早已睁不开眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我来开路。乔迪，你跟我们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。好、好......希望我能帮上忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是你必须要做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，我们会转变战略，优先确保审判庭的技术人员能安全抵达这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"在这场战役中，我们无暇顾及一个自说自话的阿戈尔人的死活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人。你不明白重新抵达这座岛屿的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从惩戒军发现灯塔残存的讯号至今，我们十七次试图登陆这里，其中有八次成功踩上这片礁石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数百名战士，三位审判官，没有人活着回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道阿戈尔的优越道德，教你们放弃对英雄的尊重与缅怀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官和我......伊比利亚人会为那些葬身大海的亡魂祭奠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无意对你们的道德挑三拣四。只是，面对海洋，我们势单力薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请便吧，但我们时间紧迫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"踏上礁石。\n巨物躲藏在漆黑的风中，只有抬头凝视，才能从一片昏沉的天空里将它分辨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i27"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊比利亚之眼。\n一双紧闭的眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那座小镇上的雕塑，比例尺一定标错了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是，我们曾经的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，第一次亲眼目睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二人无言片刻，驻足打量着这仅存于文献与记录中的恢宏景象。\n伊比利亚坚韧的现实仍旧超过她被教育的那般，艾丽妮如此想到。尽管那些深海猎人对他们满怀不屑，尽管国家的平衡确实在崩溃。\n但这座灯塔就像是一个象征。关于过去的风声与野心。关于欲望与对未知的桀骜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论你此刻心中翻涌着什么情感，铭记它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些建筑，这些破损的剑与灯，这些礁石，这片海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要把人类究竟在斗争中建立了什么铭记在心，时时刻刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若不敬畏牺牲，天秤则无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心前进吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回家了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果我们在这里找到了凯尔希和二队长要找的，也许可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"忍耐一下吧......就快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里太安静了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"明明都是恶臭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，礁石上满是溟痕的残留，能看见一些人造物的痕迹，大都腐朽了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅缓步轻踱，抬首望向延伸向昏黑天空的高塔。\n伊比利亚之眼向天指去，就好像在这有限的土地上，生命伸长脖颈，想看见未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陆上诸国竭尽全力复制出了布雷奥甘留下的遗产，这些所谓灯塔，尽是对阿戈尔技术的模仿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这空无一物的大海上，这座灯塔又在等着什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它究竟是看着海洋，还是看着陆地呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。这里本就是恐鱼的巢穴，它们没有立刻出现，也许只是一种防御性的护巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们也该来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诡异的窸窣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"数量......不算多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"海，这里已经看不见海岸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怀念吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是在说，我们不能流血。在这里，会很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们还刺不穿我们的肌肤。只要不停下你的舞步，这些数量，还不足以杀死我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（灯塔......果然和小镇上那座雕像一模一样。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（也就是说，家里的那些图纸，确实是爸妈留下的伊比利亚之眼的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我的父母曾经......就是在这里......）"},{"type":"narration","text":"乔迪回头望向海洋。\n每一天，他都会回想起自己所见到的那片灰蒙蒙的海岸。没有活力的颜色，没有希望的人群。\n可是，啊，看看这座灯塔吧，乔迪这么想到。\n蒂亚戈叔叔说得对，他们都是英雄，他们本该伟大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......深海猎人们应该就在不远处休整，她们也会参与战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了在盐风城所见到的，她们的血很特殊，凯尔希并没有向审判庭全盘托出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明、明白，所以她们是不能信任的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你在审判庭地下看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海嗣”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你应当还记得它的扭曲，它的生命力，它的......平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"在盐风城，她们曾与那样的怪物为敌，并获得胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经见过真相了，那就重新审视你的过去和伊比利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"撕毁脑海里的旧景！得出你自己的判决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——（摩擦礁石的窸窣声）——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"它们已经准备好了。退守巢穴，伺机而动，现在来驱赶外敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！真是奇迹，外面这些控制面板还有反应，但我不清楚这些东西的驱动原理是什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我在找！我包里带着家里的那些研究笔记！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道！是这本......不、不对......咿，这本怎么被弄湿了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！它们来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"波涛汹涌。\n水面掀起数十米高的傲慢，日复一日地破碎，屈服于礁石与三个月亮。\n一个月亮明亮。一个月亮晦暗。这是亘古的月亮，挂在天上。\n剩下一轮月色，来自海浪的间隙，浪峰的顶端。\n月光来自他曾信仰的名号。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
